OL,3,CFormer Top Gear host Richard Hammond
OL,4,Cfined #999 for speeding in sports cars
OL,6,FFormer Top Gear host Richard Hammond
OL,7,Fhas been convicted of speeding twice
OL,8,Fin three weeks in a Bentley and a
OL,9,FPorsche.
OL,11,FA police officer with a handheld
OL,12,Fcamera caught the 56-year-old TV
OL,13,Fpresenter driving his Porsche Taycan
OL,14,FCross Turismo at 68mph in a 50mph
OL,15,Flimit on the A40, in Pencraig,
OL,16,FHerefordshire on December 2 last year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
