OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785286070
OL,3,CFormer Top Gear host Richard Hammond
OL,4,Cfined #999 for speeding in sports cars
OL,6,FAlmost three weeks later, he was
OL,7,Fclocked speeding at 82mph in a 70mph
OL,8,Fin his Bentley Continental GT on the
OL,9,FA50 Rudhall Overbridge in
OL,10,FHerefordshire.
OL,12,FHammond pleaded guilty via his lawyer
OL,13,Fto two charges of speeding and was
OL,14,Fgiven seven penalty points on his
OL,15,Flicence at Telford Magistrates' Court
OL,16,Flast week.
OL,18,FHe was made to pay #1,771 - two fines
OL,19,Fcosting #333 and #666, #240 in fees
OL,20,Fand victim surcharges totalling #532.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
