OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785286070
OL,3,CFormer Top Gear host Richard Hammond
OL,4,Cfined #999 for speeding in sports cars
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FCourt papers revealed that West Mercia
OL,12,FPolice had been trying to contact
OL,13,FHammond for weeks and had sent
OL,14,Fmultiple letters to his various
OL,15,Fmultimillion-pound homes, including a
OL,16,FGrade II listed castle and a farm
OL,17,Festate in Herefordshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
