PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785286070
OL,3,CFormer Top Gear host Richard Hammond
OL,4,Cfined #999 for speeding in sports cars
OL,6,FThe letters were returned marked as
OL,7,F"addressee gone away" and police
OL,8,Feventually found him at his #2million
OL,9,Fmansion near Abergavenny in Wales,
OL,10,Fwhere more than 30 vehicles are
OL,11,Fregistered.
OL,13,FHammond received further allegations
OL,14,Fthat he had failed to identify himself
OL,15,Fas the guilty driver.
OL,17,FHowever, his lawyer claimed he had
OL,18,F"posted the reply himself" in a First
OL,19,FClass letter confirming his identity,
OL,20,Fand the extra charges were dropped.
