OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785286070
OL,3,CFormer Top Gear host Richard Hammond
OL,4,Cfined #999 for speeding in sports cars
OL,6,FRichard Hammond, known as "The
OL,7,FHamster" co-presented popular driving
OL,8,Fprogramme Top Gear with James May and
OL,9,FJeremy Clarkson between 2002 and 2015.
OL,11,FHe nearly died in a 320mph jet car
OL,12,Fcrash while filming the programme in
OL,13,F2006, and he and Clarkson were later
OL,14,Fgiven a three-month driving ban in
OL,15,FFrance in 2013 after they were caught
OL,16,Fspeeding while making an episode of
OL,17,Fthe show.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
